/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025 the middle went from 199% of normal in March to April down to 12% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 38% of normal on the middle. Grid 16016 had its driest year in 2011, at 31% of normal.</p>"}
